message: "If you use this workflow, please cite it as below."
title: "MetaOperonMiner: metagenome-resolved reconstruction of metal resistance operon-like modules in aquatic environments"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-04"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Lôbo"
    given-names: "Teresa de Lisieux Guedes Ferreira"
    affiliation: "Federal University of Alagoas"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TeresaLobo/MetaOperonMiner"
url: "https://github.com/TeresaLobo/MetaOperonMiner"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - metagenomics
  - resistome
  - mobilome
  - heavy metals
  - operons
  - aquatic microbiomes
  - HMMER
  - environmental microbiology
abstract: "MetaOperonMiner is a reproducible bioinformatics workflow for reconstructing candidate metal resistance operon-like modules from environmental metagenomic assemblies using HMM-based annotation, contig-level genomic organization, and mobilome-associated screening."
